  "description": "Yara is a soft and addictive gourmand fragrance that blends creamy tropical fruits with vanilla sweetness and smooth musky warmth. The scent feels feminine, playful, and comforting while maintaining a clean elegant softness throughout the wear. The opening introduces heliotrope, orchid, and tangerine, creating a creamy fruity-floral freshness with a soft tropical touch. The heart develops into tropical fruits and gourmand accords, adding juicy sweetness and a smooth creamy character that feels warm and inviting. The base settles into vanilla, musk, and sandalwood, leaving a soft, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels cozy, feminine, and addictive. Yara is perfect for women who enjoy sweet creamy fragrances with tropical fruity warmth and a smooth musky finish.",
